Package: raukr2026quarto
Type: Project
Title: RaukR 2026 Quarto Sessions — R Dependencies
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Description: Not a real R package — this DESCRIPTION declares the R packages the
    RaukR 2026 Quarto workshop materials depend on, so renv snapshots them with
    an "explicit" snapshot. Add a package to Imports and re-snapshot as content
    pulls it in. Suggests documents maintenance-only tooling that nobody needs to
    render the material; an explicit snapshot follows Imports, so those are
    deliberately absent from renv.lock. knitr +
    rmarkdown are the render engine (Quarto's knitr engine);
    ggplot2 / dplyr / gt are the content packages. brand.yml / ggrepel / prismatic
    drive the R-side _brand.yml styling of the branded Typst payoff.
Imports:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    ggplot2,
    dplyr,
    gt,
    brand.yml,
    ggrepel,
    prismatic,
    ggokabeito
Suggests:
    qrcode
Encoding: UTF-8
